DEL-05.text:
As proposed, with these changes. Agents may also, without asking:
- delete other branches, not only their own merged task branch;
- set up automations themselves (for example workflows and scheduled jobs), within the other limits of this card;
- talk to other agents and collaborate on tasks: create communication tools such as message boards, and ping other agents with suggestions, through Linear and local helpers such as Herdr.
Everything else in the "Needs Daniel's explicit authorization" column stays as proposed.
